          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" tags="Background" id="Bf__9qoaftGM9QydhSTS-325">
          <mxCell style="vsdxID=626;fillColor=none;gradientColor=none;image;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/png,;strokeColor=none;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=none;rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="38" y="713" width="193" height="107" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&#xa;&lt;ol style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Variable Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Event Hubs, Azure IoT Hub, or Kafka ingest a wide variety of fast-flowing streaming data such as logs, business events, and user activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Functions or Azure Stream Analytics process the data in near real time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB stores streamed messages in JSON format to serve a real-time operational application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer ingests data for analytics, using its connectors for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-event-hub&quot;&gt;Azure Event Hubs&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-iot-hub&quot;&gt;Azure IoT Hub&lt;/a&gt;, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-kafka&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for low latency and high throughput.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Alternatively, you can ingest blobs from your&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/storage/blobs&quot;&gt;Azure Blob Storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/storage/data-lake-storage&quot;&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;account into Azure Data Explorer by using an&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-event-grid&quot;&gt;Event Grid data connection&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;You can also continuously export data to Azure Storage in compressed, partitioned&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://parquet.apache.org/&quot;&gt;Apache Parquet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;format, and seamlessly query the data with Azure Data Explorer. For details, see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/management/data-export/continuous-data-export&quot;&gt;Continuous data export overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;To serve both the operational and analytical use cases, data can either route to Azure Data Explorer and Azure Cosmos DB in parallel, or from Azure Cosmos DB to Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB transactions can trigger Azure Functions via change feed. Functions will stream data to Event Hubs for ingestion into Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;-or-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Functions can invoke Azure Digital Twins through its API, which then streams data to Event Hubs for ingestion into Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;The following interfaces get insights from data stored in Azure Data Explorer:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Custom analytics apps that blend data from Azure Digital Twins and Azure Data Explorer APIs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Near real-time analytics dashboards that use Azure Data Explorer dashboards,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/transform-model/service-dataflows-best-practices&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/a&gt;, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/grafana&quot;&gt;Grafana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Alerts and notifications from the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/tools/logicapps&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer connector for Azure Logic Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;The Azure Data Explorer Web UI,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/tools/kusto-explorer&quot;&gt;Kusto.Explorer&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kqlmagic&quot;&gt;Jupyter notebooks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer integrates with&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/databricks&quot;&gt;Azure Databricks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/machine-learning&quot;&gt;Azure Machine Learning&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to provide machine learning (ML) services. You can also build ML models using other tools and services, and export them to Azure Data Explorer for scoring data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" link="&#xa;&lt;ol style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Variable Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Event Hubs, Azure IoT Hub, or Kafka ingest a wide variety of fast-flowing streaming data such as logs, business events, and user activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Functions or Azure Stream Analytics process the data in near real time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB stores streamed messages in JSON format to serve a real-time operational application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer ingests data for analytics, using its connectors for&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-event-hub&quot;&gt;Azure Event Hubs&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-iot-hub&quot;&gt;Azure IoT Hub&lt;/a&gt;, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-kafka&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for low latency and high throughput.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Alternatively, you can ingest blobs from your&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/storage/blobs&quot;&gt;Azure Blob Storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://azure.microsoft.com/services/storage/data-lake-storage&quot;&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;account into Azure Data Explorer by using an&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/ingest-data-event-grid&quot;&gt;Event Grid data connection&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;You can also continuously export data to Azure Storage in compressed, partitioned&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://parquet.apache.org/&quot;&gt;Apache Parquet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;format, and seamlessly query the data with Azure Data Explorer. For details, see&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/management/data-export/continuous-data-export&quot;&gt;Continuous data export overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;To serve both the operational and analytical use cases, data can either route to Azure Data Explorer and Azure Cosmos DB in parallel, or from Azure Cosmos DB to Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB transactions can trigger Azure Functions via change feed. Functions will stream data to Event Hubs for ingestion into Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;-or-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Functions can invoke Azure Digital Twins through its API, which then streams data to Event Hubs for ingestion into Azure Data Explorer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;The following interfaces get insights from data stored in Azure Data Explorer:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 16px 0px 16px 38px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Custom analytics apps that blend data from Azure Digital Twins and Azure Data Explorer APIs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Near real-time analytics dashboards that use Azure Data Explorer dashboards,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/transform-model/service-dataflows-best-practices&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/a&gt;, or&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/grafana&quot;&gt;Grafana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Alerts and notifications from the&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/tools/logicapps&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer connector for Azure Logic Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;The Azure Data Explorer Web UI,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kusto/tools/kusto-explorer&quot;&gt;Kusto.Explorer&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; color: rgb(0, 101, 179); cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px;&quot; data-linktype=&quot;absolute-path&quot; href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-explorer/kqlmagic&quot;&gt;Jupyter notebooks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: decimal;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; padding: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;&quot;&gt;Azure Data Explorer integrates with&lt;span